    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wow, another great day to be rich!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/463183b0c8ed478cfe28df483fee94c2.avif?t=1743619090\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel to the world of Amille</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You did it! After months of searching, You've worked hard and finally found a wonderful place to begin exhibiting art from all over the world. The gallery space is filled with old pieces (and some secrets...), but could use some big collections to really drum up excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/3334a5b88606332f7202a8ce5e2b60c2.avif?t=1743619090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bargain with collectors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/c101f8c1f1ecf70590c7fc41719b5374.avif?t=1743619090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to curating the greatest collection of art will bring you face-to-face with some of Amille's most curious individuals, each with their own unique personality and tastes. How far are you willing to go to get what you want?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/ee2f56c8f70985b77080d08cf69ab512.avif?t=1743619090\" data-has-big width=800 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems in the gallery. Discover what horrors lie in the dark at night, and do what you must to survive...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Every choice matters. Speak with collectors, locals, and staff to build your reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Reputation only goes so far... Gain money to bid on and buy art from collectors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A menagerie of horrors come alive at night. Use your knowledge from the day and do what you must to survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Become immersed in the game's unique art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/ff8286244b1e29cf038471f74ae8f303.avif?t=1743619090\" width=800 height=824 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wow, another great day to be rich!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/463183b0c8ed478cfe28df483fee94c2.avif?t=1743619090\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel to the world of Amille</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You did it! After months of searching, You've worked hard and finally found a wonderful place to begin exhibiting art from all over the world. The gallery space is filled with old pieces (and some secrets...), but could use some big collections to really drum up excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/3334a5b88606332f7202a8ce5e2b60c2.avif?t=1743619090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bargain with collectors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/c101f8c1f1ecf70590c7fc41719b5374.avif?t=1743619090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to curating the greatest collection of art will bring you face-to-face with some of Amille's most curious individuals, each with their own unique personality and tastes. How far are you willing to go to get what you want?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/ee2f56c8f70985b77080d08cf69ab512.avif?t=1743619090\" data-has-big width=800 height=580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems in the gallery. Discover what horrors lie in the dark at night, and do what you must to survive...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Every choice matters. Speak with collectors, locals, and staff to build your reputation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Reputation only goes so far... Gain money to bid on and buy art from collectors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A menagerie of horrors come alive at night. Use your knowledge from the day and do what you must to survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Become immersed in the game's unique art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433280/extras/ff8286244b1e29cf038471f74ae8f303.avif?t=1743619090\" width=800 height=824 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Travel to the world of Amille as Larue, an eager art curator looking to make a name for themselves. Build your reputation by talking with collectors and locals, and explore the ever-expanding gallery as you buy more artwork. But beware, as every choice matters when day turns to night...",
